Deployment Steps
On Image Builder (ip-10-2-170-115)
bash# Copy scripts
cp graceful-shutdown.sh /usr/local/bin/
cp poll-lifecycle.sh /usr/local/bin/
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/graceful-shutdown.sh
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/poll-lifecycle.sh

# Add to crontab
crontab -e
Add this line:
# Poll for ASG lifecycle termination hook every minute
* * * * * /usr/local/bin/poll-lifecycle.sh

# Rotate log weekly
0 0 * * 0 > /var/log/graceful-shutdown.log

From Jarek's PC — Add IAM Permission
aws iam put-role-policy ^
  --role-name ganz-cloudwatch-addnl-metrics ^
  --policy-name WNXT-Lifecycle-Complete ^
  --policy-document file://add-lifecycle-iam-policy.json ^
  --region us-east-1

Complete Graceful Shutdown Flow
ASG decides to terminate instance
        ↓
Lifecycle hook → Terminating:Wait (max 5 minutes)
        ↓
poll-lifecycle.sh detects Terminating:Wait (within 1 min)
        ↓
graceful-shutdown.sh runs:
  Step 1: Deregister from ALB readiness TG → no new traffic ✅
  Step 2: Sleep 30s → in-flight connections drain ✅
  Step 3: systemctl stop wnxt-user.service ✅
  Step 4: Remove from hub hostslist + trigger reconcile ✅
  Step 5: Signal ASG CONTINUE ✅
        ↓
Instance terminates cleanly ✅

Total time ≈ 45 seconds ← well within 5 min ✅





